FINOS AI Governance Framework
-----------------------------

The framework's files are copyright FINOS and licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC-BY-4.0):
https://github.com/finos/ai-governance-framework/blob/67b8c3257695d5ede09d262798bf28a0e58d4740/LICENSE

src/ai_governance_framework/schema/ai_governance_framework.yaml,
src/ai_governance_framework/datamodel/ and project/ model those files. Their
structure is this project's, and the enums' titles and the document statuses'
descriptions are FINOS's words.

src/ai_governance_framework/data/ and src/ai_governance_framework/mappings/ are
adaptations of FINOS's files at commit 67b8c3257695d5ede09d262798bf28a0e58d4740, which
scripts/build_catalogue.py and scripts/build_sssom_mappings.py write. The changes are
the ones those scripts' comments state: front matter keys renamed where the schema
needs another spelling, an identifier and a path added from each file's name, the page
bodies left out, the nested taxonomies written as lists of records, and each citation
written as an SSSOM row. They stay under CC-BY-4.0, with this credit. tests/data/valid/
quotes a few of the same files' values.

